<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig dienst unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">grueß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevor</unclear>. Es ist <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear>
